{"method_name": "getGrandTotal", "logic": "The method calculates the grand total of an order by summing the subtotal, shipping cost, sales tax, other (non\u2011global) adjustments and global adjustments. Each component is obtained by calling its dedicated service method. No loops are involved; the calculation is a straight\u2011line addition of five BigDecimal values. If any component is null the underlying service should return BigDecimal.ZERO (implicit contract).", "mathematical_formula": "grand_total = sub_total + total_shipping + total_sales_tax + order_other_adjustment_total + order_global_adjustments", "formula_terms": [{"name": "sub_total", "source_method": "getSubTotal", "required": true}, {"name": "total_shipping", "source_method": "getTotalShipping", "required": true}, {"name": "total_sales_tax", "source_method": "getTotalSalesTax", "required": true}, {"name": "order_other_adjustment_total", "source_method": "getOrderOtherAdjustmentTotal", "required": true}, {"name": "order_global_adjustments", "source_method": "getOrderGlobalAdjustments", "required": true}], "schema_keys": ["sub_total", "total_shipping", "total_sales_tax", "order_other_adjustment_total", "order_global_adjustments"], "test_payload": {"sub_total": 100.0, "total_shipping": 10.0, "total_sales_tax": 5.0, "order_other_adjustment_total": 2.0, "order_global_adjustments": 0.0}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 117.0}, "test_cases": [{"name": "baseline", "payload": {"sub_total": 100.0, "total_shipping": 10.0, "total_sales_tax": 5.0, "order_other_adjustment_total": 2.0, "order_global_adjustments": 0.0}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 117.0}}, {"name": "with_global_discount", "payload": {"sub_total": 200.0, "total_shipping": 15.0, "total_sales_tax": 12.0, "order_other_adjustment_total": 5.0, "order_global_adjustments": -20.0}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 212.0}}, {"name": "zero_values", "payload": {"sub_total": 0.0, "total_shipping": 0.0, "total_sales_tax": 0.0, "order_other_adjustment_total": 0.0, "order_global_adjustments": 0.0}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 0.0}}]}